    <content type="text">Original Innioasis PR1 software **R2-V1.34-20260208**.

- Model: **PR1** (Innioasis)
- Package: `rom_pr1.zip`
- Build tag: `R2-V1.34-20260208`
- Build date: 2026-02-08

## Install

1. Download `rom_pr1.zip` (every numbered volume if the release has more than one, then `cat rom_pr1.zip.* &gt; rom_pr1.zip`).
2. Unzip it. Keep the scatter file next to the images.
3. Open SP Flash Tool, choose **Download Only**, load the scatter file from the archive and flash.
4. Or use Innioasis Updater CE: &lt;https://innioasis.app/guide.html&gt;

This wipes the player. Back up music and recordings first.

